{[#]} 1. Rh8# {Anderssen’s Mate is a checkmate pattern that features a rook
supported by a pawn as it checkmates the opposing king along the eighth rank
from the corner. The pawn is then also defended by another piece or pawn. The
pattern is named after Adolf Anderssen, a German chess master from the 19th
century.} *

